### Login Request to retrieve a token
POST http://localhost:4004/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bickey@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token) %}

### CREATE patient
POST http://localhost:4004/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Api-Gateway Token test",
  "email": "apiGatewayTokenTest@gmail.com",
  "address": "123 Main St, VA",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-06-15",
  "registeredDate": "2025-08-23"
}